1
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.860
This kick is for my mother!

2
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.860
No!

3
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.860
I refuse to accept this!

4
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.860
I am the noble lord Arthur!

5
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:52.540
Let's go!

6
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.540
You're awake.

7
00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.520
The doctor said you inhaled too much smoke.

8
00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.720
The transfer document burnt in the fire.

9
00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.680
Even if it hadn't, it would be legally invalid.

10
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.840
You scared me to death!

11
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:10.540
I thought you'd go bankrupt and I'd have to support you from now on.

12
00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.000
If I really went bankrupt, would the future lady of the manor still want me?

13
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.280
Whether you're a wealthy young spherer or a penniless nobody, I only want you Vincent.
